; Regression: a type annotation that names no type used to be DROPPED with
; rc 0 and not a word (2026-08-15).
;
; plan_type# ends with `if this.has_concept(name) = false  return after_subst` —
; the lenient exit that lets a name this root never lays out through as an
; opaque placeholder. Everything downstream then treats the binding as a pointer
; of unknown size: map_type answers `ptr`, sizeof is 8, and the program compiles.
;
; The class covered every position that takes an annotation — binding, parameter,
; return type, structure property, module-level `mutable` — and one face of it was
; already recorded under the storage lens ("a declaration whose annotation
; does not resolve to a TYPE is DROPPED, with rc 0 and no diagnostic"), where the
; first sign is a later `unknown assignment target` at a line that is not the
; mistake.
;
; xfail: unknown type: nosuchtype

let r: nosuchtype 5
print "unreachable"
